    {
      "id": 32,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "doctor cycle progress",
      "description": "Fraction of the current rolling doctor cycle that has been hashed (doctor_cycle_progress_ratio, 0 to 1), the age of the cycle cursor in seconds (doctor_cursor_age_seconds) and the projected cycle length (doctor_projected_cycle_seconds: total copy bytes over doctor.bytes_per_slice, times doctor.slice_every). The budget counts bytes of one side, the copy. A projection above doctor.interval refuses to start unless doctor.allow_slow_cycle is true. doctor_last_run_timestamp moves only when a cycle completes. Deferred slices (copy lag) extend a cycle. The doctor-mismatch alert covers a mismatch and a stale last run; no alert covers a slow cycle.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
